WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.480
Here we are at Wellgreens in Lemon
Grove located at 6859 Federal

00:00:05.500 --> 00:00:10.620
Boulevard in Lemon Grove, San
Diego, directly off the 94 Freeway

00:00:10.640 --> 00:00:12.340
open from 6 a.m.

00:00:12.380 --> 00:00:14.260
to 9:45 p.m.

00:00:14.280 --> 00:00:19.720
daily. Wellgreens got
its start in cannabis

00:00:19.740 --> 00:00:21.460
manufacturing back in 2018.

00:00:21.860 --> 00:00:24.600
We held one of San Diego's
early manufacturing licenses.

00:00:24.880 --> 00:00:28.680
We made distillate and developed
several successful cannabis vape brands.

00:00:29.340 --> 00:00:33.480
Then in 2021, we opened our first
walk-in dispensary in La Mesa.

00:00:33.960 --> 00:00:39.400
Since then, we have grown into a locally
operated, family-oriented team serving

00:00:39.420 --> 00:00:41.420
customers across 12 locations.

00:00:41.940 --> 00:00:43.780
Few things that matter most to us.

00:00:44.120 --> 00:00:49.300
Great customer service, a knowledgeable
team, fresh and reliable inventory, and

00:00:49.320 --> 00:00:51.660
deals that help customers get more value.

00:00:52.600 --> 00:00:57.060
One of the core principles behind
Wellgreens business is the strong inventory

00:00:57.080 --> 00:01:02.340
control. We take pride in keeping the
products that our customers count on in stock

00:01:02.360 --> 00:01:06.400
day after day, week after week,
month after month, year after year.

00:01:06.900 --> 00:01:10.580
We know that people count on these products
and we need to make sure that we have

00:01:10.600 --> 00:01:12.340
them available regularly.

00:01:15.220 --> 00:01:19.540
All right folks, we're here with
Manny down at our corporate office.

00:01:19.900 --> 00:01:22.780
Manny is the head
purchaser for Wellgreens.

00:01:23.080 --> 00:01:28.460
Manny has got the immense job of making
sure all 12 of our locations from Vista to

00:01:28.480 --> 00:01:33.200
Chula Vista are stocked with fresh new
product and amazing brand collaborations.

00:01:34.000 --> 00:01:38.300
Manny, can you tell us about any product
collaborations you've been very excited

00:01:38.320 --> 00:01:42.780
about, upcoming ones, and maybe give us a
little bit of a glimpse into the process

00:01:42.800 --> 00:01:45.920
of bringing new brands
into the Wellgreens family?

00:01:46.240 --> 00:01:48.580
Yeah Mike, thanks for taking the
time to organize these videos.

00:01:48.880 --> 00:01:52.120
We are very excited about
our collaboration with CAM.

00:01:52.880 --> 00:01:56.440
In the last, I want to say, two years,
the number one premium flower brand.

00:01:56.640 --> 00:02:00.900
We're the only company in California that
has a collaboration with them ongoing.

00:02:01.780 --> 00:02:05.740
You know, usually about 30 to 40 percent
of the strains we have on hand are

00:02:05.760 --> 00:02:06.840
the CAM collaborations.

00:02:07.180 --> 00:02:08.860
You can only find those
genetics in our stores.

00:02:09.400 --> 00:02:14.480
So it's, I like to look at it as the
number one cannabis dispensary chain

00:02:14.500 --> 00:02:17.780
with the number one premium flower brand.

00:02:18.060 --> 00:02:19.440
And now we have a collaboration.

00:02:19.740 --> 00:02:22.180
It's a unique label,
really, really unique.

00:02:22.700 --> 00:02:25.360
They sell out almost instantly
every time we get them.

00:02:25.520 --> 00:02:26.760
Check them out when you can.

00:02:27.360 --> 00:02:31.980
Another one I was excited about, we did
with Geek Bar, a famous nicotine brand.

00:02:32.500 --> 00:02:35.300
And now they came out with Geek THCX.

00:02:35.740 --> 00:02:41.160
We have three strains, an indica, a
sativa, a hybrid, that you can only find

00:02:41.180 --> 00:02:45.280
in our stores as exclusive
flavors that we curated together.

00:02:47.440 --> 00:02:52.760
For the company, I have to think
about the consumers, the customers

00:02:52.780 --> 00:02:55.060
that visit us every day
and what's best for them.

00:02:55.300 --> 00:02:59.960
And if you can give us a little more
insight on curating products and bringing

00:02:59.980 --> 00:03:02.500
brands into the Wellgreens fold.

00:03:03.120 --> 00:03:08.440
So our number one rule when bringing the
brand is I have to work directly with the

00:03:08.460 --> 00:03:10.840
supplier, the cultivator,
or the manufacturer.

00:03:11.500 --> 00:03:14.600
We don't bring in any brands that
are not direct from the source.

00:03:14.780 --> 00:03:18.520
This allows us to have the lowest possible
price, which we pass on to the consumers.

00:03:19.400 --> 00:03:23.880
A lot of gimmicks in the industry right
now for cannabis dispensaries where they'll

00:03:23.900 --> 00:03:28.020
advertise a big percent off every day,
whether it be 30 percent off, 40 percent off,

00:03:28.440 --> 00:03:29.560
50 percent off daily.

00:03:30.340 --> 00:03:33.160
If you compare, you'll notice that
you can compare and save with us.

00:03:33.660 --> 00:03:38.240
And our everyday price is lower than their
30 percent off or more everyday price.

00:03:38.420 --> 00:03:43.500
And on top of that, all of our sales
are discounted on that lower price.

00:03:43.660 --> 00:03:48.880
So if we run 30 percent off on a product,
it's usually 50 percent cheaper than

00:03:48.900 --> 00:03:50.120
our competitors.

00:03:50.440 --> 00:03:52.260
So I like to say compare and save.

00:03:53.100 --> 00:03:54.140
Awesome. Right on, Manny.

00:03:54.280 --> 00:03:58.920
Well, thank you so much for taking
the time, doing an amazing job here.

00:03:59.120 --> 00:04:03.460
I know that inventory is a huge
part of the retail operation game.

00:04:03.820 --> 00:04:08.760
And I feel like we are absolutely crushing
it in terms of other shops in the area.

00:04:08.900 --> 00:04:10.540
So thank you so much
for everything you do.

00:04:10.640 --> 00:04:11.560
We appreciate it.

00:04:11.800 --> 00:04:12.940
Thanks for talking to us.

00:04:13.240 --> 00:04:14.160
Thank you. All right.

00:04:18.480 --> 00:04:19.380
All right, folks.

00:04:19.560 --> 00:04:22.540
We're here at Lemon Grove with Tim, one
of our regular friends at Wellgreens.

00:04:22.780 --> 00:04:25.100
Tim, let us know why you keep
coming back to Wellgreens.

00:04:25.340 --> 00:04:30.140
Because the good people here are friends
of mine and they got the best weed.

00:04:30.840 --> 00:04:31.460
That's right.

00:04:31.480 --> 00:04:31.920
Awesome, man.

00:04:31.940 --> 00:04:33.340
Thank you so much for taking your time.

00:04:33.660 --> 00:04:34.460
We appreciate you.

00:04:34.780 --> 00:04:36.220
Have a great rest of your night, man.

00:04:36.360 --> 00:04:38.280
Thanks for watching, folks.

00:04:38.600 --> 00:04:39.560
See you in our next video.

